  "body": "Main is red on `first_part_programs`. The test `first_router_part_posts_the_shipped_program` fails on `60b19abe8` (0 passed, 1 failed, exit 101).\n\n## What the test shows\n\nPanic at `crates/app/tests/first_part_programs.rs:28:5`: `examples/first-router-part.nc` is stale.\n\nThe shipped example has 166 lines. The generated program has 165. The one difference is line 82: `T2 M6` is in the shipped file and is absent from the posted output. The generated file is at `/tmp/camcraft-first-router-part-program-pin-*.nc`. No file under `crates/app/tests/golden` changed.\n\n## Why it is P1\n\nIf the example project's second operation uses `T2` and the post writes no `T2 M6`, that operation runs with the previous tool. That is wrong posted G-code.\n\nThe other reading: the example project now uses one tool, and the shipped file is stale. Confirm this before any regeneration.\n\n## What to do\n\n1. Find the cause: read the example project's operations and tools, and the post's tool-change path. Name which side is wrong.\n2. If the post loses a needed tool change: fix the post and pin it with a test that fails without the change.\n3. If the example is stale: regenerate `examples/first-router-part.nc` in one commit that names the cause, and say why the output is correct.\n4. Do not only regenerate the file. The difference must be explained.\n\n## Related\n\n- PR #3422 is blocked on this: its quick gate is red on the same test.\n- The post-merge run for `60b19abe8` covers the same suite.\n",
